    <string name="kojiki_fw_rule_roaming_desc"><![CDATA[The <i>Roaming</i> toggle of this <i>app</i> is off and mobile data was roaming, so the connection was blocked. It holds under every firewall status, bypassed and excluded included.<br/><br/> To change go to <i>All Apps</i> tab.]]></string>
