    <string name="kojiki_roaming_cd">Allow or block this app while roaming</string>
    <string name="kojiki_roaming_bulk_title">Roaming — %1$d listed apps</string>
    <string name="kojiki_roaming_bulk_msg">Allow or block roaming data for every app the list is showing. Roaming is mobile data abroad: an app whose mobile-data toggle is off has no roaming either, and its roaming toggle shows that. Roaming off holds under every status: a bypassed or excluded app with roaming off has no access while roaming.</string>
